Night market trend on March 30, 2026;
#ETH 

Observation of market direction from 2 AM to 4 AM:
If the price at 2 AM is ≤1997≤2003,
look for a bearish trend, otherwise look for a bullish trend;
If the price at 4 AM is ≤1997≤2003,
if below 2003, look for a bearish trend, otherwise look for a bullish trend;

Remember to observe the price at 1997 before 4 AM, and at 4 AM check where the price is around 2003! Look for a bullish trend above! Look for a bearish trend below! Include the time that follows, be careful to control the liquidation position sufficiently, to avoid sudden sharp attacks from the market makers! Strictly maintain your stop-loss points!

Position as shown in the picture! Adjust your orders by adding or subtracting 2-5 points! Reduce by 2-5 points for short positions, otherwise add points for long positions!
Trade carefully, market makers are not human, sudden sharp movements from them are an unchangeable habit these days!
